// Micron's MT25QU01GBBB datasheet, "1Gb, 1.8V Multiple I/O Serial Flash Memory" (mt25q_qlkt_u_01g_bbb_0,
// read 2026-10-21 from the operator's copy): a stacked device of two 512Mb die; SPI-compatible with
// extended, dual and quad I/O in STR and DTR, 166 MHz maximum in STR; JEDEC 3-byte signature BB21h;
// 64KB sectors, 4KB and 32KB subsectors; 3- and 4-byte address modes. The ordering code reads by its
// part-number figure: U = 1.7-2.0 V, 01G = 1Gb, B = 2 die stacked, B generation, B die revision,
// 8 = RESET and HOLD# pins, E = 64KB sectors, 12 = 24-ball T-PBGA 6 x 8 mm (5 x 5 array), 0 = standard
// security, S = standard, IT = -40 to +85 C. Micron's FBGA part-marking decoder maps the package code
// RW188 to this part number (operator lookup, 2026-10-21). The operator's copy of the datasheet is the
// Drive file cited second.
data extdeps_external_authority_anchor: ExternalAuthority = ExternalAuthority {
  uri: Uri {
    scheme: Https
    locator: "www.micron.com/products/memory/nor-flash/serial-nor-flash/part-catalog/part-detail/mt25qu01gbbb8e12-0sit"
  }
}

